<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover"><meta name="theme-color" content="#f8f8fc"><meta name="description" content="MINUKIMI — someone you haven't met yet."><link rel="manifest" href="manifest.webmanifest"><link rel="icon" href="icons/icon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"><link rel="stylesheet" href="app.css"><title>MINUKIMI</title></head><body><div class="app"><main class="shell" id="shell"><div class="toast" id="toast">I see it.</div>
<section class="screen onboard active" id="on1"><div class="brand">MINUKIMI</div><div class="hero-art"><svg class="hero-lines" viewBox="0 0 420 250"><defs><linearGradient id="h1a"><stop stop-color="#ff3f9f"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#8f52ff"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id="h1b"><stop stop-color="#6e63ff"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#4fe6dc"/></linearGradient></defs><path d="M-15 72 C66 22 115 104 183 76 C236 54 260 5 327 27 C369 42 397 83 438 70" stroke="url(#h1a)"/><path d="M-12 172 C70 211 112 122 181 146 C231 164 252 207 313 186 C363 170 394 131 439 148" stroke="url(#h1b)"/></svg></div><div><h1>Someone you haven't met yet.</h1><p>Less swiping. More intention. Meet a person, notice what pulls you in, then make one deliberate move.</p><div class="dots"><i class="dot on"></i><i class="dot"></i><i class="dot"></i></div><button class="cta wide" id="on1Next">Next</button></div></section>
<section class="screen onboard" id="on2"><div class="topbar"><button class="icon" onclick="show('on1')">←</button><div class="brand">MINUKIMI</div><span class="ghost-slot"></span></div><div class="hero-art"><div class="prompt-card"><small>A glimpse beyond the facts</small><b>In my head, I'm...</b><div class="prompt-example">already living near the sea, wearing linen and kissing first.</div></div></div><div><h1>Show the part facts miss.</h1><p>Not a résumé. Not a personality test. One short line about the life, mood or version of you that feels true inside.</p><div class="dots"><i class="dot"></i><i class="dot on"></i><i class="dot"></i></div><button class="cta wide" id="on2Next">Next</button></div></section>
<section class="screen onboard" id="on3"><div class="topbar"><button class="icon" onclick="show('on2')">←</button><div class="brand">MINUKIMI</div><span class="ghost-slot"></span></div><div class="hero-art" style="height:310px"><div class="teach-grid"><div class="teach-card like"><div class="teach-copy"><b>Like them?</b><span>Bring the halves together</span></div><svg viewBox="0 0 292 100"><defs><linearGradient id="tl"><stop stop-color="#ff3f9f"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#8f52ff"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id="tr"><stop stop-color="#6e63ff"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#4fe6dc"/></linearGradient></defs><path class="half left" d="M8 58 C32 88 68 89 99 73 C114 65 129 64 137 77 C121 63 109 53 105 41 C101 28 108 19 119 18 C127 17 134 21 137 27" stroke="url(#tl)"/><path class="half right" d="M155 27 C158 21 165 17 173 18 C184 19 191 28 187 41 C183 53 171 63 155 77 C163 64 178 65 193 73 C224 89 260 88 284 58" stroke="url(#tr)"/></svg></div><div class="teach-card pass"><div class="teach-copy"><b>Not for you?</b><span>Flick either half away</span></div><svg viewBox="0 0 292 100"><path class="half left" d="M8 58 C32 88 68 89 99 73 C114 65 129 64 137 77 C121 63 109 53 105 41 C101 28 108 19 119 18 C127 17 134 21 137 27" stroke="#ff4ea1"/><path class="half right" d="M155 27 C158 21 165 17 173 18 C184 19 191 28 187 41 C183 53 171 63 155 77 C163 64 178 65 193 73 C224 89 260 88 284 58" stroke="#57dccc"/></svg></div></div></div><div><h1>Don't swipe right. Connect.</h1><p>The heart is the choice. Pull the two halves together if you want to connect. Flick one away if you don't.</p><div class="dots"><i class="dot"></i><i class="dot"></i><i class="dot on"></i></div><button class="cta wide" id="on3Next">Create profile</button></div></section>
<section class="screen" id="profilePhoto"><div class="topbar"><button class="icon" onclick="show('on3')">←</button><div class="brand">MINUKIMI</div><span class="ghost-slot"></span></div><div class="page"><div class="kicker">Create profile · 1 of 4</div><div class="progress"><i style="width:25%"></i></div><h1 class="headline">Your main photo.</h1><p class="sub">One clear human face only. Pets, landscapes, objects and group shots can live later in your gallery, not here.</p><div class="photo-frame" id="photoFrame"><img id="photoPreview" alt="Your main photo"><div class="photo-empty" id="photoEmpty">Choose a photo where your face is easy to recognise.</div><div class="photo-zone"></div><div class="photo-guide"><svg viewBox="0 0 320 350" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M119 139 C119 91 137 63 160 63 C183 63 201 91 201 139 C201 181 184 207 160 207 C136 207 119 181 119 139 M77 308 C84 244 112 217 160 217 C208 217 236 244 243 308"/></svg></div></div><div class="photo-rule"><i class="good-dot"></i><span>Keep your face above the darker text zone.</span></div><div class="photo-status" id="photoStatus">Main-photo rule: exactly one visible face, large enough to recognise.</div><div class="crop-control" id="cropControl"><span>Framing</span><input id="cropRange" type="range" min="100" max="135" value="100"></div><input id="photoInput" type="file" accept="image/*" hidden><div class="photo-actions"><button class="secondary" id="choosePhoto">Choose photo</button><button class="cta" id="photoNext" disabled>Next</button></div></div></section>
